                                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="2">
                                    <path
                                        d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z" />
                                </svg>
                                Add to Wishlist
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <div class="perks">
                            <div class="perk">
                                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="1.8">
                                    <rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" rx="2" />
                                    <path d="M16 8h4l3 5v3h-7V8z" />
                                    <circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5" />
                                    <circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5" />
                                </svg>
                                <div class="perk-text">
                                    <strong>Free Shipping</strong>
                                    <span>On orders over ₹150</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="perk">
                                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="1.8">
                                    <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
                                </svg>
                                <div class="perk-text">
                                    <strong>Lifetime Warranty</strong>
                                    <span>Authenticity guaranteed</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TABS -->
        <section class="tabs-section">
            <div class="tab-nav">
                <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab(this,'desc')">Description</button>
                <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab(this,'reviews')">Reviews (24)</button>
            </div>

            <div id="desc" class="tab-panel active">
                <div class="product-details-content">
                    <h3>Product Details</h3>
                    <p>A modern blend of elegance and minimalism, the Gold Geometric Ring features a sleek, structured
                        design inspired by contemporary geometry. Crafted with a polished gold finish, this ring adds a
                        refined touch to any outfit.</p>
                    <p>Its clean lines and timeless style make it perfect for both everyday wear and special occasions.
                        Lightweight, stylish, and effortlessly chic — it's a must-have piece for those who appreciate
                        modern luxury.</p>
                    <ul class="feature-list">
                        <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2.5">
                                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" />
                            </svg>Brilliant-cut diamond</li>
                        <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2.5">
                                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" />
                            </svg>18K white gold setting</li>
                        <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2.5">
                                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" />
                            </svg>Conflict-free certified</li>
                        <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2.5">
                                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" />
                            </svg>Comes with authentication certificate</li>
                        <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2.5">
                                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" />
