                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="reviews" class="tab-panel">
                <div class="reviews-grid">
                    <div class="review-card">
                        <div class="reviewer">
                            <div class="avatar">P</div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="reviewer-name">Priya S.</div>
                                <div class="reviewer-date">March 2026</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stars" style="margin-left:auto"><span class="star"
                                    style="font-size:0.8rem">★★★★★</span></div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="review-text">Absolutely stunning ring! The geometric design is so unique and the gold
                            finish looks exactly like the photos. Gets so many compliments.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="review-card">
                        <div class="reviewer">
                            <div class="avatar">A</div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="reviewer-name">Ananya R.</div>
                                <div class="reviewer-date">February 2026</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stars" style="margin-left:auto"><span class="star"
                                    style="font-size:0.8rem">★★★★★</span></div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="review-text">Beautifully crafted and arrived in lovely packaging. Perfect for both
                            casual and formal wear. Very happy with this purchase!</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="review-card">
                        <div class="reviewer">
                            <div class="avatar">M</div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="reviewer-name">Meera K.</div>
                                <div class="reviewer-date">January 2026</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stars" style="margin-left:auto"><span class="star"
                                    style="font-size:0.8rem">★★★★<span style="color:var(--border)">★</span></span></div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="review-text">Great quality ring, slightly larger than expected but fits well. The
                            design is elegant and modern. Would recommend!</p>
